        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kwezi kwa mbere Abisirayeli bose bashika mu bugaragwa bw’i Zini, baca baguma i Kadeshi. Aho ni ho Miriyamu yapfiriye aca ahambwaho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko habura amazi, abantu bahagurukira kugwanya Mose na Aroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batatira Mose bavuga bati: “Iyo dupfuma dupfira rimwe na benewacu hamwe bagwa imbere y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni kuki mwazanye abantu b’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " muri ubu bugaragwa, kugira ngo twebwe n’ibitungwa vyacu dupfire hano? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni kuki mwatuduganye mudukuye muri Egiputa mukatuzana aha hantu habi? Nta ngano, nta misukoni, nta mizabibu canke amakomamanga; kandi nta n’amazi yo kunywa ariho!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose na Aroni bava imbere y’ikoraniro baja ku muryango w’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro bubama hasi, maze ubwiza bw’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " burababonekera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " abarira Mose ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Akira ya nkoni yawe, ugende mwe na Aroni mukurwawe ukoranye Abisirayeli bose. Uze ubwire ico gitandara imbere yabo na co kizosuka amazi yaco. Uzokura amazi muri ico gitandara kugira ngo iryo koraniro ryose n’ibitungwa vyabo baze banywe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Mose afata ya nkoni ayikura imbere y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", nk’uko yari yamutegetse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We na Aroni bakoranya Abisirayeli bose imbere ya ca gitandara hanyuma Mose ababarira ati: “Umvirize yemwe mwa bagarariji mwe! Mbega twoshobora gukura amazi muri iki gitandara ngo munywe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Mose akiriza ukuboko kwiwe akubita ca gitandara kabiri na ya nkoni yiwe. Amazi aca aradudubiza, abantu baranywa n’ibitungwa vyabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " abarira Mose na Aroni ati: “Kubera yuko mutanyizigiye bikwiye ngo mumpeshe icubahiro nk’Uwera imbere y’Abisirayeli, ntimuzoshikana ubu bwoko mu gihugu ngiye kubaha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
